{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35280492_native.mp3","text":"Ná wasi gyinae a etwa to."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292449_native.mp3","text":"Me ne no traa dan biako mu."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35280546_native.mp3","text":"Wɔtɔn Asetra a Enni Awiei"}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292434_native.mp3","text":"Ahude Ho Anigye a Wɔkyerɛ"}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292427_native.mp3","text":"Nhwehwɛmufo foforo nnye saa nneɛma a wɔahu yi ntom."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292440_native.mp3","text":"Ɔkwan no so ankasa na menam yi? ’"}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35280548_native.mp3","text":"German kasa ho nimdeɛ a mewɔ no sua."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35280547_native.mp3","text":"Mehwɛ kwan sɛ ɔbɛba bere biara."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292425_native.mp3","text":"mɛyɛ deɛ metumi biara."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35280594_native.mp3","text":"Me ne no gyee nhyehyɛe foforow no ho akyinnye."}
{"audio":"tw/unknown/tw_u_35292437_native.mp3","text":"Nkurɔfo kae sɛ wabɔ dam."}
